12. ERROR HANDLING — SPECIFIC CATCH BLOCKS REQUIRED
============================================================

NEVER use a generic catch-all as the only handler.
ALWAYS catch specific exceptions and give the user a clear,
actionable message in Basque. Follow this pattern:

try
{
    // operation
}
catch (SQLiteException sqlEx) when (sqlEx.Result == SQLite3.Result.Constraint)
{
    // Duplicate or constraint violation
    ErroreMezua = "Datu bikoiztua: sarrera hau dagoeneko existitzen da.";
}
catch (SQLiteException sqlEx)
{
    // Generic DB error
    ErroreMezua = "Datu-base errorea: ezin izan da gorde. Saiatu berriro.";
    LogErrorea(sqlEx);
}
catch (HttpRequestException httpEx)
{
    // Network error (photo upload, API calls)
    ErroreMezua = "Sare errorea: konexioa egiaztatu eta saiatu berriro.";
    LogErrorea(httpEx);
}
catch (TaskCanceledException)
{
    // Timeout
    ErroreMezua = "Eskaerak denbora muga gainditu du. Saiatu berriro.";
}
catch (UnauthorizedAccessException)
{
    // Permission denied (file, camera, storage)
    ErroreMezua = "Baimena ukatu da. Ezarpenetan baimena eman.";
}
catch (ArgumentNullException argEx)
{
    // Null/empty required value
    ErroreMezua = "Eremu bat edo gehiago hutsik daude. Bete beharrezko eremuak.";
    LogErrorea(argEx);
}
catch (ArgumentException argEx)
{
    // Invalid argument (bad format, bad value)
    ErroreMezua = "Baliogabeko balioa: " + argEx.Message;
    LogErrorea(argEx);
}
catch (InvalidOperationException opEx)
{
    // Logic error (wrong state, session expired, etc.)
    ErroreMezua = "Eragiketa baliogabea. Berriz saiatu saioa hasita.";
    LogErrorea(opEx);
}
catch (IOException ioEx)
{
    // File read/write error (photo save, cache)
    ErroreMezua = "Fitxategi errorea: ezin izan da argazkia gorde.";
    LogErrorea(ioEx);
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    // Last resort — unexpected error
    ErroreMezua = "Ustekabeko errorea gertatu da. Garatzailearekin jarri harremanetan.";
    LogErrorea(ex);  // Always log the full exception here
}

RULES for error handling:
  - Try/catch ONLY in ViewModels and Services (never in Views)
  - Every catch block MUST set ErroreMezua or show a Toast — never silent
  - Every catch block MUST call LogErrorea() — never empty
  - Never show raw exception messages (ex.Message) to the user
  - Empty inputs/fields: validate BEFORE the try block with guard clauses
  - Show errors via Toast/Snackbar (CommunityToolkit.Maui), not alerts
  - ViewModel must always expose: IsKargatzean (bool), ErroreMezua (string?)

