13. XAML AND UI RULES
============================================================

  - x:Name values must be in Basque
    Example: x:Name="GastuZerrenda", x:Name="BidaliTekla"
  - All styles in ResourceDictionary (App.xaml or merged dicts)
  - No inline styles except unavoidable one-off overrides

Phone vs Tablet adaptation:
  - Phone:  StackLayout vertical, min 44px touch targets
  - Tablet: Grid 2-column master-detail layout
  - Use OnIdiom in XAML for layout switching
  - Admin panel on tablet: list + detail side by side
  - Admin panel on phone:  list -> navigate -> detail page

Images:
  Aspect="AspectFit", CacheStrategy="InMemory"
  Local preview from file path, then replace with server URL on save

